      rows: [{ t: 'Pain 2/10 without the PCA', a: 0, r: 'Goal met. The pain goal is 2–3/10.' },
        { t: 'Passing flatus and tolerating feeding', a: 0, r: 'Goal met. The ileus has resolved and nutrition is under way.' },
        { t: 'Calcium 8.9 mg/dL', a: 0, r: 'Goal met. Back in range.' },
        { t: 'Lungs clear, SpO₂ 97% on room air', a: 0, r: 'Goal met.' },
        { t: '“I’ll stick to beer on the weekends from now on.”', a: 1, r: 'Needs follow-up. Any alcohol can bring the pain back, and repeated attacks lead to chronic pancreatitis — teach no alcohol, and offer Alcoholics Anonymous (Al-Anon or Alateen for family).' }],
      ask: 'Is the attack over — and is the next one prevented?',
